{"id":"n93478-1-5","stage":2,"title":"유치하다 · 幼小","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93478-1-5-1","ko":"저 녀석들이 삼촌을 놀려!","zh":"那几个家伙在取笑叔叔呢！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"녀석들이","meaning":"家伙，小子","explanation":"녀석：家伙，小子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"녀석","audio":"/audio/0e723d29b157aa0fccf9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41586","senseId":"2","lemma":"녀석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"삼촌을","meaning":"叔叔，舅舅","explanation":"삼촌：叔叔，舅舅；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"삼촌","audio":"/audio/5d1a410b7ca871d4064c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61142","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼촌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀려!","meaning":"戏弄，玩弄","explanation":"놀리다：戏弄，玩弄；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"놀리다","audio":"/audio/f61038364c18d6de907b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28322","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"0e723d29b157aa0f","term":"녀석","zh":"家伙，小子","audio":"/audio/0e723d29b157aa0fccf9.mp3","entryId":"41586","definition":"(昵称)男孩子。","pronunciation":["녀석"]},{"id":"5d1a410b7ca871d4","term":"삼촌","zh":"叔叔，舅舅","audio":"/audio/5d1a410b7ca871d4064c.mp3","entryId":"61142","definition":"用于指称或称呼父母的兄弟。","pronunciation":["삼촌"]},{"id":"f61038364c18d6de","term":"놀리다","zh":"戏弄，玩弄","audio":"/audio/f61038364c18d6de907b.mp3","entryId":"28322","definition":"抓住别人的失误或缺点加以嘲弄。","pronunciation":["놀리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/42ccbd07d9a2ce2bf487.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n93478-1-5-2","ko":"네가 참아. 아직 유치한 아이들이잖니.","zh":"你忍着点吧。他们毕竟还是些幼稚的孩子啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참아.","meaning":"忍耐，忍受，忍住","explanation":"참다：忍耐，忍受，忍住；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"참다","audio":"/audio/1cfaf7914b38f877c7e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29772","senseId":"2","lemma":"참다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유치한","meaning":"幼小，稚嫩","explanation":"유치하다：幼小，稚嫩；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"유치하다","audio":"/audio/248ee733a05ea5d5af69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93478","senseId":"1","lemma":"유치하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이들이잖니.","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；잖니：提醒听者双方已知的事实，带反问或确认语气：“不是……吗”。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"1cfaf7914b38f877","term":"참다","zh":"忍耐，忍受，忍住","audio":"/audio/1cfaf7914b38f877c7e3.mp3","entryId":"29772","definition":"抑制、控制住悲伤、恐惧、怒火等感情。","pronunciation":["참ː따"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"248ee733a05ea5d5","term":"유치하다","zh":"幼小，稚嫩","audio":"/audio/248ee733a05ea5d5af69.mp3","entryId":"93478","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["유치하다"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]}],"audio":"/audio/160bb1281e02ae10ec10.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.273,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=93478","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":76,"sequenceScore":2.0997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你忍着点吧。他们毕竟还是些幼稚的孩子啊。","最近我完全没胃口啊。","那几个家伙在取笑叔叔呢！"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你忍着点吧。他们毕竟还是些幼稚的孩子啊。","那几个家伙在取笑叔叔呢！","最近我完全没胃口啊。"],"answer":0}]}
